Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.14.58-rt59 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.14.58 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.14-rt
  Head SHA1: c99782582a723d895e9407dc58851c5e0c0fef11


Or to build 3.14.58-rt59 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.14.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.14.58.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.14/patch-3.14.58-rt59.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
